/Title (Today, this custom is no longer practiced, and human connections in general have grown distant. More and more people lean toward the mindset of "I owe nothing to anyone," forgetting that humans are social beings who cannot survive in isolation. The goal of this collection is to reinterpret that direct, nurturing bond - symbolized by milk - within modern realities.)
